            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The level of General Service Technicians will be reviewed quarterly. Each year, the highest number of General Service Technicians in any of the preceding four (4) quarters will be used to determine the number of General Service Technicians that will be promoted the first Sunday in May, if any, in order to meet the General Service Technicians' guarantee of no less than seventy (70), exclusive of probationary employees required in the Collective Bargaining Agreement.",
