        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The Service Technician classification requires that an employee shall have qualified and satisfactorily performed the duties of a Service Technician Apprentice and shall be able to perform the following described duties: performing all duties prescribed for the Service classification; turning on and off, setting and removing all meters except setting elevated pressure meters; performing all services on electric air conditioning; and shall demonstrate a thorough knowledge of established Company standards and policies.",
